            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[#Wed Sep 30 08:07:56 CEST 2026
graphRagAnchor=true
graphRagFuzzyThreshold=0.92
graphRagGroup=application
graphRagReviewBand=0.75
graphRagExtractionHints=The main system is named in the title ('System Design Document for R-ICMS', 'VITAM - Architecture', 'System Architecture Description of LocAdoc') and in 'System Overview', 'Identification', 'Vue d'ensemble'. Other systems appear in 'System Context', 'External Interfaces', 'Interfaces externes du système', 'Significant Systems' lists ('State Automated Driver License System (SADLS) Issues Driver License Credentials'), 'Reference Documents', application maps ('cartographie applicative') and as the source or destination of interfaces. Use the full name as name and the short form in acronym; when only the acronym is printed, use it as the name. Extract external partner systems too, but not products (those are Technology) or organisations.
graphRagMatch=fuzzy
]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="status">1970354901745664</ATT>
